EMA Records is seeking a highly motivated and experienced Marketing Manager to join our growing team. **Job Summary:** The Marketing Manager will be responsible for developing and executing marketing strategies to promote our artists and releases. This includes managing social media, creating marketing campaigns, coordinating promotional activities, and analyzing marketing data. **Responsibilities:** * Develop and implement marketing plans for assigned artists and releases. * Manage social media accounts and create engaging content. * Coordinate promotional activities such as radio promotion, press outreach, and tour support. * Analyze marketing data and track campaign performance. * Manage marketing budgets. * Collaborate with other departments such as A&R, sales, and publicity. * Stay up-to-date on industry trends and best practices. **Qualifications:** * Bachelor's degree in Marketing or a related field. * 3+ years of experience in music marketing. * Strong understanding of social media marketing. * Excellent communication and interpersonal skills. * Ability to work independently and as part of a team. * Strong analytical and problem-solving skills. * Passion for music. **To Apply:** Please submit your resume and cover letter to [jobs@emarecords.com](mailto:jobs@emarecords.com). **EMA Records is an equal opportunity employer.**
